  "description": "<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"356\">The Elder Scrolls Online: Morrowind is een online role-playing game voor de PlayStation 4 die zich afspeelt in de wereld van Tamriel. Spelers verkennen het eiland Vvardenfell, vol quests, dungeons en gevechten, terwijl ze hun personage ontwikkelen en samenwerken of strijden met andere spelers.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"367\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"386\"><strong data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"386\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"403\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"547\">\r\n<li data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"439\">\r\n<p data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"439\">⭐ Uitgebreide online RPG-wereld</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"471\">\r\n<p data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"471\">⭐ Nieuwe regio: Vvardenfell</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"506\">\r\n<p data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"506\">⭐ Veel quests en verhaallijnen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"547\">\r\n<p data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"547\">⭐ Geschikt voor multiplayer gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"569\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"732\">\r\n<li data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"601\">\r\n<p data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"601\"><strong data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"585\">Platform:</strong> PlayStation 4</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"653\">\r\n<p data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"653\"><strong data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"613\">Game:</strong> <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\">The Elder Scrolls Online: Morrowind</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"702\">\r\n<p data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"702\"><strong data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"666\">Genre:</strong> Online role-playing game (MMORPG)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"732\">\r\n<p data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"732\"><strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"715\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"752\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"772\">\r\n<li data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"772\">\r\n<p data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"772\">Game met doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"796\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"829\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>",
